+re-argued and no reviewer verdict was disputed:
+
+  round 1  FAIL  the sotd coverage gate moved to the new counter and its DIVISOR did not — 15
+                 team-seasons diluted, including both Ligue 1 sides, on the metric that feeds the
+                 deserved-points regression
+  round 2  FAIL  the same class again in finishing_efficiency_pct: goals from an awarded match over
+                 a shots-on-target denominator that can never see them, up to +60%. Plus the new
+                 columns having no descriptions.
+  round 3  FAIL  every rate in both builders enumerated, NO third instance found; one missing
+                 not_null on the new denominator
+  round 4        the two-line fix
+
+⭐ THE REASON ROUNDS 1 AND 2 DID NOT FIND EACH OTHER, recorded because it is the useful part: their
+victims are DISJOINT. The divisor bug hits teams whose awarded match has no stat line; the finishing
+bug hits teams whose awarded match SCORED. Ligue 1's awarded fixture is the 0-0, so it appears in the
+first list and not the second. Fixing one told me nothing about the other, and "I have fixed the
+same-window problem" was not the same claim as "I have checked every same-window formula". Only the
+exhaustive sweep at round 3 closed the class.
+
+⚠ WHAT HE DID NOT RULE. Nothing about the freshness guard, which is what this whole investigation
+started from, is still unfixed, and failed the nightly again on 2026-09-07 — leaving the intermediate
+layer a day behind fct_fixture and corrupting the first set of numbers measured for this MR.
